type: software
title: "Library Hold Queues CLI built with Pixeltable"
abstract: "A command-line hold queue for a public library: titles and patron holds as Pixeltable tables with computed shelf-slip codes and pickup deadlines, a pxt config doctor, and a service client that honors 503 Retry-After (JOB_REFUSED) from Pixeltable background job routes."
